cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in a project or publication, please cite it as below."
title: "Video Saver: an open source Android video downloader for YouTube, Instagram, Facebook and TikTok"
abstract: >-
  Video Saver is a free and open source Android application that downloads videos from social
  media and video platforms and saves them to the device as standard H.264 MP4 files. It runs
  yt-dlp locally on the phone, requires no account, and contains no advertising or analytics.
type: software
